            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1153-f2" n="4" xml:id="d1153-f2-content">
                <p>Spokesman of the Chinese Communist Party delegation at Nanking.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1153-f3" n="5" xml:id="d1153-f3-content">
                <p>Col. Frederick J. Dau, Assistant Military Attaché and Executive Officer in the
                    Office of the Military Attaché.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
